"@startuml KYC-State-Machine
!theme plain
title VaultGuard RWA - KYC State Machine\n\nskinparam state {\n  BackgroundColor<<pending>> LightYellow\n  BackgroundColor<<approved>> LightGreen\n  BackgroundColor<<rejected>> LightCoral\n  BackgroundColor<<failed>> Orange\n}\n\n[*] --> SUBMITTED : Investor uploads documents\n\nSUBMITTED <<pending>> : Off-chain review\nSUBMITTED : Can view status\nSUBMITTED : Cannot subscribe/transfer\n\nSUBMITTED --> IN_REVIEW : SUPER_ADMIN starts review\nSUBMITTED --> REJECTED : SUPER_ADMIN rejects\n\nIN_REVIEW <<pending>> : Under compliance review\nIN_REVIEW : Sanctions check in progress\nIN_REVIEW : Cannot subscribe/transfer\n\nIN_REVIEW --> APPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN : SUPER_ADMIN approves\nIN_REVIEW --> REJECTED : SUPER_ADMIN rejects\n\nAPPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN <<pending>> : Off-chain approved\\nAwaiting blockchain confirmation\nAPPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN : Oracle queued\nAPPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN : UI shows \"Pending on blockchain\"\nAPPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN : Cannot subscribe/transfer\n\nAPPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN --> APPROVED : Oracle success\\n(receipt + confirm)\nAPPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN --> FAILED_ON_CHAIN : Oracle retry exhausted\n\nAPPROVED <<approved>> : Off-chain approved\\nAND onChainVerified=true\nAPPROVED : Can subscribe/redeem/transfer\nAPPROVED : Wallet registered in IdentityRegistry\n\nAPPROVED --> REVOKED : SUPER_ADMIN revokes\\n(compliance breach)\n\nFAILED_ON_CHAIN <<failed>> : Chain write failed\nFAILED_ON_CHAIN : Requires ForceSync\nFAILED_ON_CHAIN : Four-eyes recovery\nFAILED_ON_CHAIN : Cannot subscribe/transfer\n\nFAILED_ON_CHAIN --> APPROVED : ForceSync success\\n(Admin A initiates\\nAdmin B approves)\n\nREJECTED <<rejected>> : Documents rejected\nREJECTED : Can resubmit\nREJECTED : Cannot subscribe/transfer\n\nREJECTED --> SUBMITTED : Investor resubmits\n\nREVOKED <<rejected>> : Identity revoked\nREVOKED : All tokens frozen\nREVOKED : Cannot subscribe/transfer\nREVOKED : Requires new KYC\n\nREVOKED --> SUBMITTED : New KYC submission\n\nnote right of APPROVED_PENDING_CHAIN\n  Oracle Worker:\n  1. Pick up approval\n  2. Call registerIdentity()\n  3. Poll for receipt\n  4. Bounded retry with backoff\n  5. Set onChainVerified on success\n  6. FAILED_ON_CHAIN on exhaustion\nend note\n\nnote right of FAILED_ON_CHAIN\n  ForceSync Recovery:\n  1. Admin A initiates\n  2. Admin B (≠A) approves\n  3. HSM/KMS signs transaction\n  4. Audit trail recorded\n  5. Transition to APPROVED\nend note\n\nnote bottom of APPROVED\n  Business Rules:\n  - Subscribe requires APPROVED + onChainVerified\n  - Redeem requires APPROVED + onChainVerified\n  - Transfer requires both parties APPROVED + onChainVerified\n  - On-chain canTransfer is final authority\nend note\n\n@enduml"